+/*
+ * Raye ASIO driver, sound server side
+ *
+ * The driver talks to PipeWire through its JACK library, which runs the
+ * whole duplex cycle in one callback at the graph's quantum. The host's
+ * buffer switch is PE code and cannot run on that thread, so the JACK
+ * thread hands each cycle to the host thread and waits for it.
